        "l2vpn-svc:l2vpn-svc?container/l2vpn-svc:sites?container/l2vpn-svc:site?list/l2vpn-svc:site-network-accesses?container/l2vpn-svc:site-network-access?list/l2vpn-svc:access-diversity?container/l2vpn-svc:constraints?container/l2vpn-svc:constraint?list/l2vpn-svc:target?container/l2vpn-svc:group?list/l2vpn-svc:group-id?leaf",
