        "l2vpn-svc:l2vpn-svc?container/l2vpn-svc:sites?container/l2vpn-svc:site?list/l2vpn-svc:site-network-accesses?container/l2vpn-svc:site-network-access?list/l2vpn-svc:service?container/l2vpn-svc:qos?container/l2vpn-svc:qos-classification-policy?container/l2vpn-svc:rule?list/l2vpn-svc:id?leaf",
